    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Built in the c. 1950’s situated at the Upper end of Arklow town, just off the Coolgreaney Road in a well-established residential area of town, short walk to schools, supermarkets, public transport, bus and rail, churches, and all town amenities are all close to hand.\r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market in good order throughout having been well maintained by the present owners, ideal opportunity for first time buyers or investors to create comfortable family home with the benefit of lovely private rear garden. A lovely starter home in most convenient and central location.\r\n\r\nGREAT OPPORTUNITY TO PURCHASE A LOVELY COMPACT HOME IN MOST CONVENIENT AND CENTRAL LOCATION"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL\r\n1.90m x 1.79m\r\nTiled hall, stairs off to first floor. Telephone point.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\n5.15m x 3.06m\r\nLovely bright room located to front of house dual aspect windows, feature fire place, tiled heart and timber surround. Carpet to floor.\r\n\r\nDINING ROOM\r\n3.21m x 2.47m\r\n\r\nKITCHEN\r\n3.48m x 1.08m\r\nFitted kitchen with units and wall level, single drainer, integrated electric cooker, electric hob and oven. Tiled floor. Wall shelving.\r\n\r\nDOWNSTAIRS BEDROOM 1 (Master Bedroom)\r\n3.87m x 3.64m\r\nNice bright spacious room located to back of house.\r\n\r\nBathroom / Wet Room\r\n2.17m x 2.07m\r\nComprising shower cubicle, power shower, wc and whb, nice tiling, Velux window. Floor tiled, part tiled walls.\r\n\r\nHall to Back Door\r\n1.35m x 1.36m\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLANDING\r\n1.95m x 1.50m\r\nCarpet to floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n3.75m x 5.18m\r\nBright room, fitted wardrobe,\r\ncarpet to floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\n3.28m x 2.48m\r\nLaminate floor, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM\r\n2.11m x 1.78m\r\nComprises shower cubicle with Triton T90 instant electric shower, wc and whb, fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nWalled in front garden in lawn. Pedestrian side access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nSmall block-built boiler house, which houses the central heating boiler, outdoor tap for easy gardening. Lovely private rear garden in lawn, great place to sit on those lazy summer days and enjoy the sunshine.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains electricity, water and sewage. Oil fired radiator type central heating.\r\n\r\nNEGOTIATOR\r\n\r\nPETER MILLS PROPERTY\r\n19 Lower Main Street, Arklow, Co. Wicklow V14 V6P0\r\n\r\n0402 32911\r\ninfo@petermillsproperty.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tWithin walking distance to schools, shops, supermarkets\r\n•\tLarge rear private garden\r\n•\tuPVC double glazed windows \r\n•\tFibre optic broadband available in the area"
      },
